# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/3Blorenge.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Agent Blorenge part III
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# The name "Agent Blorenge part II" refers only to the order of surveying,
# not a gelogical feature.
# 
# Survey conducted on Saturday 12th November by Morgannwg Caving Club.
# 
# Surveyed by: Pete Bolt, Andy Deeley, Dave Glover, Ben Lovett, Charles Bailey
# Data entry: Tim Long
# 
# 

survey ab3

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1	2	14.5	253	0	# Choke at 1 -- now dug into tube surprise
  2	3	13.9	262	0
  3	4	7.3	247	0	# Connection
  4	5	8.0	174	0
  5	6	12.1	213	0	# Squirrel Rift
  6	6-2	3.7	305	0	# Squirrel rift station 2

endcentreline
endsurvey
